{"3565090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goobies 2", "steam_appid": 3565090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies 2 is a third-person, co-op roguelike where you battle  blobs and bosses. Unlock goobies, mutations, omens and skins. Make unique builds and splatter blobs while seeking out the creator through the beautiful blobverse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies come in all shapes and forms, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Choose from the original goobies or discover new beings of goo!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your goobie with mutated genes. Each gene is unique and behaves differently, some are even sentient and have a will of their own! Find new powerful synergies that have yet to be discovered by combining them in the gene pool.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find powerful Omens that evolve with new properties as they grow in number. Does your build call for an Echoing Hole or a Prickly Meteorite?  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/f39f3c8abb05daa1c340ddaca147b4a5.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies 2 is a third-person, co-op roguelike where you battle  blobs and bosses. Unlock goobies, mutations, omens and skins. Make unique builds and splatter blobs while seeking out the creator through the beautiful blobverse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies come in all shapes and forms, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Choose from the original goobies or discover new beings of goo!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your goobie with mutated genes. Each gene is unique and behaves differently, some are even sentient and have a will of their own! Find new powerful synergies that have yet to be discovered by combining them in the gene pool.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find powerful Omens that evolve with new properties as they grow in number. Does your build call for an Echoing Hole or a Prickly Meteorite?  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/f39f3c8abb05daa1c340ddaca147b4a5.avif?t=1781593831\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Splatter blobs with your friends, unlock never-before-seen Goobies with unique abilities, discover powerful genetic goobie mutations and combine omens for the second blobbath experience in Goobies 2!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/b586d9d9e4d9c911df25511eb2b9d9ed755f7410/header.jpg?t=1781593831", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/95892b75af3cf7db2527c7fbc3d140e9a9cea2e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781593831", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/95892b75af3cf7db2527c7fbc3d140e9a9cea2e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781593831", "website": "https://www.hoganasspel.se/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / R9 390<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux